---
const proofElements = [
  'Entry assessment',
  'Deployed project',
  'GitHub evidence',
  'PrepCoach progress',
  'Exit assessment',
  'Mock interview performance',
];
---

<section class="bg-[#F5F2EB] py-20 md:py-28 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#1A0533]/10 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#1A0533]/50 tracking-widest uppercase mb-6">
        Verified proof
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#1A0533] leading-tight mb-5">
        Your learning should leave evidence.
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-700 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          A completed course is not enough if an employer cannot tell what you understand. UniversityX is designed to show where you started, what you built and how well you can explain your work.
        </p>
        <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A0533]">Not just what you completed. What you can prove.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-[#1A0533]/10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-[#8A40F5]/10 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">✅</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Learner evidence</p>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A0533]">Verified skill profile</h3>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        {proofElements.map((item) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F5F2EB] px-4 py-4 text-[#1A0533] font-semibold">
            {item}
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
